{"id":"aa82947fba077a45","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-function-set.md","title":"Function Set","display":"df-function-set — Function Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-function-set","aliases":["58-df-function-set"],"display":"df-function-set — Function Set","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-function-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-function-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-function-set — Function Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in V\">\\(A,B\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B^A\\in V\">\\(B^A\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function\\text{-}set} \\vdash\nB^A\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(A\\times B):\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function\\text{-}set} \\vdash\nB^A\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(A\\times B):\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B^A\">\\(B^A\\)</span> is the set of all functions from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"B^A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function\\text{-}set} \\vdash\nB^A\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(A\\times B):\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"B^A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false}],"bytes":576,"backlinks":[{"id":"e9a96ab954b6013e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\kappa^\\lambda=\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(\\lambda\\times\\kappa):\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\lambda,\\kappa)\\}$ (function set, see [[../batch14/58-df-function-set.md]])"},{"id":"0c4c30f0f2c6862e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$E^\\Omega\\in V$ (see [[./58-df-function-set.md]])."},{"id":"a691a8cf95f38f20","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6ec9045ffcdae0c3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},